      "name_zh": "长词蓄力",
      "name_en": "Verbum Gravatum",
      "text_zh": "排字棒越长，落版时铅字越重。前主人的棒子磨损在最末一槽——那里的铅字总是最后落下，也最响。",
      "text_en": "The last slug always fell loudest. His composing stick is worn deepest at the far end, where the final letter once rested."
