    "doc": {
      "text_zh": "圣器操作须知 · SA-2291「词语经销商」· 版级：逆版 / Inversum\n\n一、本圣器（外观：磨损皮面账簿，封面压印字样不可读，内页空白）由气动征用管定期流转，无需申请即可领取。\n二、持有者应将账簿置于圣坛左侧。勿翻阅空白页。若听到翻页声而本人未触碰账簿，请正常继续铭刻作业。\n三、注意事项：持有期间如需移交部分收容经卷，请于移交后立即记录账目。账簿会自行合拢。\n四、以下行为已由 █ 级守卷人划除并注明",
      "text_en": "Sacred Artifact Operations Notice · SA-2291 \"The Word Broker\" · Gradus: Inversum\n\nI. This artifact (appearance: worn leather ledger, cover inscription illegible, interior pages blank) circulates through the Pneumatic Requisition Tube without formal requisition.\nII. Place the ledger to the left of the lectern. Do not read the blank pages. If you hear a page turning and have not touched the ledger, continue inscription work as normal.\nIII. Upon relinquishing a portion of your Codex Fragments, close the ledger immediately afterward. It will close on its own.\nIV. The following instruction was struck through by a ██-clearance Keeper and annotated \"SEE IR-2291\": ████████████████████████████████████████.\nV. Current recommended handling: standard. Incident rate since revision: 0. Personnel reassigned following ledger contact since revision: ██."
    }
