      "text_zh": "铅在静置时仍有重量。某守卷人在遗嘱里写：铅币不花，亦是劳作。库房因此从未真正空过。",
      "text_en": "Lead does not cease its weight in stillness. A warden once wrote: unspent coin is still labour. The vault was never truly empty."
