      "text_zh": "物品编号：SA-0441\n名称：磨损砝码（单枚，材质不明，重量每次测量结果不一致）\n版级：定版 / Fixum\n发现地点：第 III 层铸字坊，质检台抽屉，置于折叠麻布中\n\n操作须知 · SA-0441（修订版，原版已列为 Ω 级限制）\n一、砝码可正常用于铭刻基准校准。\n二、校准后，基准数值将下降至可操作范围。经复核，此为正常读数。\n三、注意事项：勿于换班前使用。若磅秤指针停转，请将砝码收回麻布，填写 F-017。\n四、████████████████。此条已删除。理由：多余。\n\n附注（手写，笔迹与正文不符）：它不是在告诉你你够了。它是在告诉你门槛一直就这么高。是标尺坏了。",
      "text_en": "Item No.: SA-0441\nDesignation: Worn Counterweight (single unit, material unconfirmed, mass inconsistent across measurements)\nGradus: Fixum\nRecovered: Layer III, Foundry Wing, calibration bench drawer, wrapped in folded burlap\n\nOperating Notice · SA-0441 (Revised. Original classified Ω-restricted.)\nI. The counterweight may be used for standard inscription threshold calibration.\nII. Post-calibration, threshold readings will fall within operable range. Cross-verification confirms readings as accurate.\nIII. Precaution: Do not use immediately before shift rotation. If balance needle ceases movement, re-wrap in burlap and file F-017.\nIV. ████████████████. Clause removed. Reason: Redundant.\n\nHandwritten annotation (authorship unverified): It isn't telling you that you're enough. It's telling you the threshold was always this low. The scale was the problem."
