      "name_zh": "命运铅币",
      "name_en": "Plumbum of Fate",
      "text_zh": "一面刻裂纹，一面刻圣印。它只有两种落法——前任掷了一辈子，说它从未出现过第三种。",
      "text_en": "One face bears a fracture, one a sigil. Its owner tossed it for a lifetime and swore it never landed any other way."
