      "name_zh": "传力铜排",
      "name_en": "Conductor Strip",
      "text_zh": "铸字房的人说，好的铜排不导力——它借力。一侧铭文组动了，两侧的铅字跟着颤。没人安装它，它就已经在那里了。",
      "text_en": "A good conductor strip doesn't carry force. It borrows it. No one installed it. It was already there."
