    "doc": {
      "text_zh": "圣器档案 SA-0██ · 版级：熔版 / Fusum\n物品描述：一具掌心大小的黄铜钟表机芯，无表盘，无指针。发条孔已满，但发条舱内为空。\n\n发现地点：第 IV 层铸字坊，D-0██9 工位，工位台面铅灰磨痕内侧。\n\n经记录现象：D-0██9 持有该物后，值班登记簿显示其连续登记 ██ 天未曾轮换。楼层主管三度前往核查，确认工位有人，未见异常，未作记录。第 ██ 日，D-0██9 编号回收，工位补员。新任 D-████ 入驻当日报告工位",
      "text_en": "Sacred Artifact SA-0██ · Gradus Formae: Fusum\nDescription: A brass clockwork movement, palm-sized. No dial. No hands. Winding crown fully depressed; mainspring chamber empty.\n\nRecovery site: Layer IV, Typecasting Ward. Interior of a lead-worn groove on D-0██9's workstation surface.\n\nObserved phenomena: Following contact, D-0██9 appeared on the duty register for ██ consecutive days without rotation. Floor supervisors confirmed the station occupied on three separate inspections. No irregularity noted. No report filed. On Day ██, D-0██9's designation was reclaimed and the station reassigned. Upon arrival, D-████ reported the workstation surface still warm. Cause: not recorded. SA-0██ was found beneath the left palm rest. Movement still running. Winding crown still fully depressed."
    }
