      "text_zh": "前主人按键时惯于借全身之力。铅字碎裂，压板一并受了力——铅字知道那份力气，便往下传了下去。",
      "text_en": "The prior keeper struck keys with his full weight. The platen remembers. The force did not stop at the crack."
